    "description": "RPC operations from `Cisco-IOS-XE-stack-power-rpc` module.\n\n**RPCs:** 1 (set-stkpwr-port-state)\n\nAll endpoints use POST on `/operations/`.\n\n**YANG Model:** [Cisco IOS-XE RPC - Cisco-IOS-XE-stack-power-rpc.yang](https://github.com/YangModels/yang/blob/main/vendor/cisco/xe/17181/Cisco IOS-XE RPC - Cisco-IOS-XE-stack-power-rpc.yang)",
